 "name_en": "Sales Commissions – External Sales Representative (2TT)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Sales Commissions – External Sales Representative (2TT)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioafe5ee107da84d57bee68b4dd806f4f7\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioafe5ee107da84d57bee68b4dd806f4f7__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Condition contracts are used in this process to enter sales commission agreements with external sales agents. In a condition contract you specify the commission recipient, the organizational and process control parameter, the business volume selection criteria, the sales commission conditions, and the settlement calendar with the settlement dates for delta accrual, partial settlement, and final settlement. The delta accruals settlement reflects a procedure in which accruals for commissions are not posted together with transactional documents but are posted at a later date in a specific settlement run. When carrying out the partial and final settlements of a condition contract, you perform the sales commission calculation based on business volume and commission conditions and you create the settlement documents that reflect an invoice from the external sales agents for the arrangement of sales deals. This scope item supports two data sources for the business volume determination: sales and distribution (SD) billing documents that have already been paid and SD billing documents without check for payment.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioafe5ee107da84d57bee68b4dd806f4f7__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Check business volume (optional)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post accruals (optional)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Partial settlement with reversal of accruals (optional)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post incoming payments (optional)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Check business volume</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Final settlement with reversal of accruals</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Final settlement with adjustments (optional)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Commission unlikelihood (optional)</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioafe5ee107da84d57bee68b4dd806f4f7__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create and administer commission agreements for external sales agents centrally</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Settle sales commissions accurately and automatically provide enhanced transparency and flexibility along the whole commission contract lifecycle</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use different data sources for commissions: Billing documents and cleared billing documents</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create and administer commission agreements for external sales agents centrally</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Settle sales commissions accurately and automatically</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Provide enhanced transparency and flexibility along the whole commission contract lifecycle</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use different data sources for commissions: Billing documents and cleared billing documents</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>销售佣金 – 外部销售代表 (2TT)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioafe5ee107da84d57bee68b4dd806f4f7\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioafe5ee107da84d57bee68b4dd806f4f7__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">在此流程中，条件合同用于输入与外部销售代理的销售佣金协议。在条件合同中，指定佣金接收方、组织和流程控制参数、业务量选择条件、销售佣金条件以及含增量应计、部分结算和最终结算的结算日期的结算日历。增量应计结算反映了一种程序，在该程序中，佣金应计不会与交易凭证一起过账，而是在特定结算运行的较晚日期过账。执行条件合同的部分和最终结算时，根据业务量和佣金条件执行销售佣金计算，并创建反映来自外部销售代理的发票以安排销售交易的结算凭证。此范围项目支持用于业务量确定的两个数据源：已付款的销售和分销 (SD) 开票凭证和不含付款支票的 SD 开票凭证。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioafe5ee107da84d57bee68b4dd806f4f7__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">检查业务量（可选）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">过账应计（可选）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">含应计冲销的部分结算（可选）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">过账收款（可选）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">检查业务量</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">含应计冲销的最终结算</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">含调整的最终结算（可选）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">佣金不可能性（可选）</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioafe5ee107da84d57bee68b4dd806f4f7__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">集中创建和管理外部销售代理的佣金协议。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">准确结算销售佣金，并自动提高整个佣金合同生命周期的透明度和灵活性</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">为佣金使用不同的数据源：开票凭证和已清算开票凭证</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">集中创建和管理外部销售代理的佣金协议。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">准确、自动地结算销售佣金</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提高整个佣金合同生命周期的透明度和灵活性。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">为佣金使用不同的数据源：开票凭证和已清算开票凭证</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
